@host = http://localhost:5080

### What the consumers did, newest first. Re-run this after each request below.
GET {{host}}/activity

### Clear the activity feed
DELETE {{host}}/activity

### Queue depth and totals
GET {{host}}/queues

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Place an order. OrderPlacedHandler then sends a PaymentRequested and an email notification.
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer": "Ana", "total": 120.50 }

### A flaky gateway: PaymentHandler retries the gateway call itself; the 3rd call succeeds in the same run.
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer": "Marko", "total": 80, "paymentFailures": 2 }

### The gateway keeps failing: after 3 calls the handler throws, and the message is archived to pgmq.a_example_payments.
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer": "Jelena", "total": 80, "paymentFailures": 5 }

### Refused: over the limit throws, and the message is archived. Pgmq never runs a failed consumer again by default.
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customer": "Big Spender", "total": 50000 }

### Publish by type: both EmailNotifier and NotificationAudit get a copy.
POST {{host}}/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Hello everyone" }

### Topic: notify.email.ana matches notify.email.* (EmailNotifier) and notify.# (NotificationAudit) -> 2 queues
POST {{host}}/notifications/notify.email.ana
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Your parcel shipped" }

### Topic: notify.sms.ana only matches notify.# -> 1 queue
POST {{host}}/notifications/notify.sms.ana
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Your code is 1234" }

### Topic: nothing matches -> 0 queues
POST {{host}}/notifications/billing.invoice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Nobody hears this" }

### Which queues a routing key would reach
GET {{host}}/topics/notify.email.ana

### FIFO groups: each account's entries arrive in order (#1, #2, #3...), accounts interleave.
POST {{host}}/ledger
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accounts": 3, "entriesPerAccount": 5 }

### Delayed delivery: shows up in /activity after 10 seconds.
POST {{host}}/reminders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Stand up and stretch", "delaySeconds": 10 }

### Purge a queue
DELETE {{host}}/queues/example_ledger
